roughly 22 categories per game; each category lists a small number of
leading athletes. This is the game-wide leaders resource -- distinct from
\code{\link[=espn_cfb_game_team_leaders]{espn_cfb_game_team_leaders()}}, which returns the leaders for a single
competitor (team).

When \code{team_detail = TRUE} (the default) the ESPN team catalog
